      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote",
        "text": "## Full Showcase - the whole pack in one chain\n\n**Chain:** `ColorDepth -> Pixelize -> Scanlines -> Subpixel Mask -> Bloom -> Chromatic Aberration -> Curvature -> Vignette -> VHS`\n\nThe signal-chain story, in order: **content** (bit depth, pixel grid) -> **screen pattern** (scanlines, phosphor mask) -> **optics** (bloom, aberration) -> **glass** (curvature, vignette) -> **the tape you recorded it on** (VHS).\n\nEvery stage is independent - bypass any node to A/B the effect. `RetroCurvature` also outputs a `MASK` of the blackened border pixels, for compositing the curved screen over another background."
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Full Showcase - the whole pack in one chain\n\n**Chain:** `ColorDepth -> Pixelize -> Scanlines -> Subpixel Mask -> Bloom -> Chromatic Aberration -> Curvature -> Vignette -> VHS`\n\nThe signal-chain story, in order: **content** (bit depth, pixel grid) -> **screen pattern** (scanlines, phosphor mask) -> **optics** (bloom, aberration) -> **glass** (curvature, vignette) -> **the tape you recorded it on** (VHS).\n\nEvery stage is independent - bypass any node to A/B the effect. `RetroCurvature` also outputs a `MASK` of the blackened border pixels, for compositing the curved screen over another background."
      ],
